### Page 1 of 5

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 16, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-13-23 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and Z & Z Sealcoating, Inc. for the 2023 Crack Seal #1 Project
 ______________________________________________
Bid #S-13-23 was solicited for the 2023 Crack Seal #1 project.  Project vicinity map included.

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1.
Z & Z Sealcoating, Inc.  Billings, Montana.
2.
Scodeller Construction.  Wixom, Michigan.

The bids were reviewed by Doug Klahn (1% Construction), and Tom Cobb (Engineering) and
their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Z & Z Sealcoating, Inc.

The total Bid Award amount is $448,265.26.

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43491 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Crack Seal)
```

